            "text": "Teen Promise Rings",
            "heading_tag": "h1"
          }
        },
        "richtext_WKEAXi": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Promise rings for teenagers should feel meaningful, personal and easy to wear. They can represent a first relationship, a close friendship, a special milestone or even a promise made to yourself. Unlike engagement rings, they do not need to feel formal or grown-up. They are about the meaning behind the moment.At The Promise Co, every ring is designed around the idea that a promise can take many forms. It might be a promise of loyalty, love, friendship, self-belief or connection. That makes our teen promise rings a thoughtful choice for anyone looking for jewellery that feels symbolic without feeling too serious.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_xtCAXi",
        "richtext_WKEAXi"
      ],
