        "heading_CqCpaN": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Choosing a promise ring for a teenager",
            "heading_tag": "h1"
          }
        },
        "richtext_jGCLJY": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>The best promise rings for teenagers are the ones that feel natural to wear. They should reflect the person’s style, but also carry a meaning that feels genuine.<br/><br/>Some teenagers prefer simple, understated designs that can be worn every day. Others may want something more romantic, such as a <a href=\"https://thepromiseco.com/collections/heart-shape-promise-rings\" title=\"https://thepromiseco.com/collections/heart-shape-promise-rings\">heart promise ring</a>, or something more personal, such as a <a href=\"https://thepromiseco.com/collections/pinky-promise-rings\" title=\"https://thepromiseco.com/collections/pinky-promise-rings\">pinky promise ring </a>or <a href=\"https://thepromiseco.com/collections/friendship-rings\" title=\"https://thepromiseco.com/collections/friendship-rings\">friendship ring</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
