    "faq_mNKFmN": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_Nq4maG": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What are promise rings for teenagers?",
            "answer": "<p>Promise rings for teenagers are rings given or worn to represent a meaningful promise. They can symbolise friendship, young love, loyalty, personal growth or an important milestone.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_Q4gTjD": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are promise rings for teenagers the same as engagement rings?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Promise rings are different from engagement rings. A promise ring is usually more personal and flexible, while an engagement ring represents a formal intention to marry. </p><p>For teenagers, promise rings should feel meaningful without creating pressure.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_kMjeN7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does a teen promise ring mean?",
            "answer": "<p>A teen promise ring can mean different things depending on the person wearing it. It might represent commitment in a relationship, a close friendship, a personal goal or a reminder of someone important.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_gyPxNV": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are promise rings suitable for teenage couples?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, promise rings can be suitable for teenage couples when the meaning is thoughtful and age appropriate. They can represent loyalty, care and connection without needing to feel like an engagement ring.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_McdyAh": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can promise rings be given between friends?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Friendship promise rings are a meaningful choice for best friends who want to celebrate their bond.</p><p> They can be matching, complementary or chosen in styles that reflect each person’s personality.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_yEKUGB": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What style of promise ring is best for a teenager?",
            "answer": "<p>Simple bands, heart rings, stackable styles and delicate stone designs are all popular choices. The <a href=\"https://thepromiseco.com/collections/promise-rings\" title=\"https://thepromiseco.com/collections/promise-rings\">best promise ring </a>is one that suits the wearer’s everyday style and feels connected to the meaning behind the gift.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_fdLaT6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Should I choose gold or silver for a teen promise ring?",
            "answer": "<p><a href=\"https://thepromiseco.com/collections/gold-promise-rings\" title=\"https://thepromiseco.com/collections/gold-promise-rings\">Gold promise rings </a>have a warm, classic look, while silver promise rings feel bright, modern and easy to style. The right choice depends on the jewellery they already wear and the finish they prefer.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_pBpdFV": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can a teenager wear a promise ring every day?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, many promise rings are designed for everyday wear. It is still important to care for the ring properly by avoiding harsh chemicals, perfumes, lotions and unnecessary exposure to water.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_m4kHjd": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which finger should a teenager wear a promise ring on?",
            "answer": "<p>There is no strict rule. Some wear a promise ring on the ring finger, while others choose the middle finger, index finger or little finger depending on comfort and personal style.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_XqNXQe": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is a promise ring a good gift for a teenager?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, if the meaning is clear and thoughtful. A promise ring can be a beautiful gift for a birthday, milestone, friendship, first relationship or personal reminder, especially when it is chosen with care.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
