        "heading_MpEBMP": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Radiant Cut Promise Rings",
            "heading_tag": "h1"
          }
        },
        "richtext_kR7Wtd": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Radiant cut promise rings offer a bold and modern expression of love and commitment. Known for their clean lines and exceptional sparkle, the radiant cut combines the structure of a rectangular or square shape with the brilliance of a round stone, creating a design that feels both refined and eye-catching.</p><p>At The Promise Co,  our radiant cut promise rings are designed to capture that balance between strength and brilliance. </p><p>The defined shape gives the ring a confident, contemporary feel, while the light-reflecting facets create a sparkle that feels full of energy and life.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
