        "heading_pHCnWC": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "What makes a Radiant Cut Promise Ring unique?",
            "heading_tag": "h1"
          }
        },
        "richtext_AtYwyq": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>The radiant cut is known for combining two distinct qualities, structure and brilliance. Originally developed to merge the elegance of step-cut stones with the sparkle of brilliant cuts, it features a high number of facets that maximise light reflection.<br/><br/>This gives radiant promise rings a distinctive look that feels more vibrant than traditional rectangular styles, while still maintaining a clean and modern silhouette.</p><p></p>"
          }
        }
      },
