        "heading_PQzCam": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>A bold, modern take on a promise ring</strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h1"
          }
        },
        "richtext_mBNGRx": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Radiant cut promise rings are often chosen by those who want a ring that feels different from traditional styles. Their clean lines give them a contemporary edge, while their brilliance ensures they never feel understated.<br/><br/>Because the radiant cut can be either square or rectangular, it offers flexibility in style, allowing you to choose a look that feels more structured or more elongated depending on your preference.<br/><br/>This versatility, combined with its striking appearance, makes the radiant cut one of the most unique options within promise rings.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
